### Create a product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "HEADPHONES-122",
  "name": "Wireless headphones",
  "description": "Wireless headphones with a charger",
  "price": {
    "amount": "220.00",
    "currency": "USD"
  },
  "categoryId": "9836f8ab-975e-4512-993e-7974515546dc",
  "attributes": {
    "color": "red"
  }
}

### Search products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?page=0&size=20

### Search with filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?minPrice=1&maxPrice=100

### Get by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/34ae03dd-41e1-48d0-857f-9b3b3210762e

### Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/34ae03dd-41e1-48d0-857f-9b3b3210762e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "HEADPHONES-123",
  "name": "Wireless headphones",
  "description": "Wireless headphones with a charger",
  "price": {
    "amount": "210.00",
    "currency": "USD"
  },
  "categoryId": "9836f8ab-975e-4512-993e-7974515546dc",
  "attributes": {
    "color": "red"
  }
}

### Activate
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/34ae03dd-41e1-48d0-857f-9b3b3210762e/activate

### Archive
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/34ae03dd-41e1-48d0-857f-9b3b3210762e/archive

### Delete (only DRAFT could be deleted)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/8ac13b7b-ed87-4050-b9b5-135ed3abb8ee